{"summary":"Solve puzzles. Recreate art. Explore mazes. Unite sweethearts.","description":"◆◆  Winner Google Play Indie Festival ‘22 ◆◆\n◆◆  Free limited demo : In-app purchase the full game. ◆◆ \n◆◆  No Ads\n\nA cozy puzzler about art. Recreate paintings by applying lines & colors in a specific order. Explore beautiful mazes & collect letters of a poem. Help two sweethearts find a path towards each other. \n\n◆ A quick note from solo-developer Thomas ◆ \nYou don't get what this game is about? That's completely normal!\n\nPart of the fun in this game is finding out the rules of the game. But don’t worry, there are always hints to help you progress! In essence it's just a calm casual puzzle game where you play with art without shame or punishment.\n\n◆ Features ◆\n+ 3 games in one\n+ More than 160 levels\n+ Lighthearted and bittersweet stories\n+ 3~4 hours of gameplay \n+ Fit for ages above 11\n+ Hints when stuck\n+ No time pressure, no-stress puzzling \n+ A relaxing jazzy soundtrack\n+ Fun art facts\n\n◆ Awards & Recognition ◆ \n\n+ Winner \"Google Play Indie Games Festival '22\"\n+ Finalist \"Apple Design Awards '22\"\n+ Winner \"Best Art\" @ Tokyo Game Show","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$4.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j8ziTu7_hg4?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UNP2NXH_gKOhA6PWqX4Z6Q_hhONVw2rYQdIs0CPgZD6SywWLmphHQ6_RXfzozDiz4Kqx-Tu73ikOi4RoRr3dBg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k1dRJ0kCuAuoNEpQpYUNbgJKh8v0-7hgJMXeXmkoV6gN1sYYL9IZ7-RWy2-V6bjkiSNUz5VLZnZLi83iOr32CA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Fyr_TfbIbVjsf9Qqz_VBvDKavho2wR8WRYKr4WCtJ7ortKYqW7pCxl3qgwLIJGb7WiT6r6cexFeiShiugFxhxw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RS23qx9H_DxXwOCXw4k4aWbGjku3k4OrkcHbYce6GcnEyEzhzLTYzv62pOk_KX2b9t1b8_TEquDqt7oixreuuQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/P-M2RH28FkfGp6QTZZfXO3f1lOuPGExowYbvXkLtcIPhl1j0g73pdPtpKAarCKOOG9-1bJgFlS4slLQ01d4WrQ","https://p